assumption = "Peers are the adopter's own toolchain and are not distributed by Rex, so the gate covers what installing @sidioralabs/rex brings in; if the release owner wants peers gated too, the allowlist decision for MPL-2.0, CC-BY-4.0 and Unlicense belongs in [design] supply_chain."
severity = "note"
